  "contentHtml": "<DIV>\r\n<DIV style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; PADDING-BOTTOM: 10px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(254,222,199); PADDING-LEFT: 10px; PADDING-RIGHT: 10px; BORDER-TOP: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; PADDING-TOP: 10px\" class=txc-textbox>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 19px\"><FONT size=3><SPAN style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></SPAN></FONT></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 19px\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2407F747556E544715\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"905\" height=\"576\" style=\"WIDTH: 905px; FLOAT: none; HEIGHT: 576px; CLEAR: none\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20150409_073059.jpg\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\"  id=\"A_2407F747556E544715BEAE\"/></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 19px\"><FONT size=3><SPAN style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></SPAN></FONT></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 19px\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2714854E556E558F16\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"870\" style=\"WIDTH: 870px; FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20150402_122247.jpg\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" height=\"576\"  id=\"A_2714854E556E558F168BA5\"/></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 19px\"><FONT size=3><SPAN style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></SPAN></FONT></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 19px\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/262C2D4D556E566309\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"886\" style=\"WIDTH: 886px; FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20150426_080641.jpg\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" height=\"576\"  id=\"A_262C2D4D556E566309B840\"/></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 19px\"><FONT size=3><SPAN style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></SPAN></FONT></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 19px\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/22153E49556E56F018\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"884\" style=\"WIDTH: 884px; FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20150506_172243.jpg\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" height=\"576\"  id=\"A_22153E49556E56F0186584\"/></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 19px\"><FONT size=3><SPAN style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></SPAN></FONT></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 19px\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/253D5136556E58B62B\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"888\" style=\"WIDTH: 888px; FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20150505_182007.jpg\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" height=\"576\"  id=\"A_253D5136556E58B62BD543\"/></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 19px\"><FONT size=3><SPAN style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다. </SPAN></FONT></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 19px\"><FONT size=3><SPAN style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</SPAN></FONT></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 19px\"><B><SPAN style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.6; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.6; FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</SPAN></SPAN></B></P></DIV>\r\n<P><BR></P></DIV>\r\n<P>인천 강화 석모도 간의 조수간만의 차</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;지금은 썰물로 물이 빠진 상태입니다</P>\r\n<P>썰물의 양도 매일 조금씩 다릅니다</P>\r\n<P>가만히 배터에 서서보면 물이 들어오는것과 나가는 것이 보입니다</P>\r\n<P>이배가 제가 타는 배인데요 강화에서 석모도 까지 1.5km 이고 배안에서 5분걸려요</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>썰물때는 항구에 배대는 콘크리트길이 잘 보이는데 </P>\r\n<P>밀물때 길은 없어지고 바로 사람들이 다니는 큰길이 나옵니다</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>갈매기가 매일 배에서 우리는 마중나오고 배웅도하고 함께 배를 타기도 해요</P>\r\n<P>석모도 수목원과 휴양림은 환상적인 아름다운 곳입니다</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/224AFF48556E539813\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"888\" style=\"WIDTH: 888px; FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20150521_145233.jpg\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" height=\"576\"  id=\"A_224AFF48556E5398136666\"/></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2640CB48556E539A18\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"878\" style=\"WIDTH: 878px; FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20150521_145237.jpg\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" height=\"576\"  id=\"A_2640CB48556E539A18D867\"/></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/22436F48556E539D17\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"904\" style=\"WIDTH: 904px; FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20150521_145238.jpg\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" height=\"576\"  id=\"A_22436F48556E539D17B76C\"/></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/263B5748556E539F1B\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"909\" style=\"WIDTH: 909px; FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20150521_145308.jpg\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" height=\"576\"  id=\"A_263B5748556E539F1BB38C\"/></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2641F248556E53A117\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"900\" style=\"WIDTH: 900px; FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20150521_145319.jpg\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" height=\"576\"  id=\"A_2641F248556E53A117D440\"/></P>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
